      "text": "<p>In&nbsp;this&nbsp;game&nbsp;you&nbsp;play&nbsp;as&nbsp;<em>Carmen</em>,&nbsp;a&nbsp;woman&nbsp;in&nbsp;her&nbsp;forties&nbsp;who&nbsp;lives&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;spaceship&nbsp;and&nbsp;dedicates&nbsp;her&nbsp;life&nbsp;to&nbsp;collect&nbsp;space&nbsp;junk.&nbsp;Her&nbsp;job&nbsp;is&nbsp;well&nbsp;known&nbsp;around&nbsp;the&nbsp;univers&nbsp;and&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;why&nbsp;many&nbsp;creatures&nbsp;end&nbsp;up&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;spaceship&nbsp;with&nbsp;hopes&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;what&nbsp;they&nbsp;need.</p>",
