      "text": "<p>This&nbsp;was&nbsp;my&nbsp;first&nbsp;time&nbsp;creating&nbsp;<strong>2D&nbsp;VFX</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;also&nbsp;my&nbsp;first&nbsp;time&nbsp;using&nbsp;Godot&nbsp;Engine.&nbsp;To&nbsp;craft&nbsp;effects&nbsp;that&nbsp;would&nbsp;match&nbsp;the&nbsp;aesthetic&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game,&nbsp;I&nbsp;created&nbsp;different&nbsp;textures&nbsp;to&nbsp;use&nbsp;as&nbsp;particles&nbsp;and&nbsp;experimented&nbsp;with&nbsp;them&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;a&nbsp;good&nbsp;result.</p>",
