      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>For&nbsp;the&nbsp;UI,&nbsp;I&nbsp;created&nbsp;two&nbsp;early&nbsp;mock-ups&nbsp;of&nbsp;how&nbsp;I&nbsp;was&nbsp;imagining&nbsp;the&nbsp;Interface&nbsp;to&nbsp;look&nbsp;like.&nbsp;As&nbsp;Carmen&nbsp;uses&nbsp;her&nbsp;spaceship&nbsp;computer&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;objects,&nbsp;I&nbsp;pictured&nbsp;it&nbsp;like&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>windows&nbsp;aesthetic</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;glamourous&nbsp;touch.&nbsp;After&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;mock-up&nbsp;and&nbsp;some&nbsp;feedback,&nbsp;I&nbsp;was&nbsp;told&nbsp;the&nbsp;design&nbsp;was&nbsp;too&nbsp;overloaded&nbsp;so&nbsp;I&nbsp;proposed&nbsp;a&nbsp;second&nbsp;option&nbsp;with&nbsp;less&nbsp;elements&nbsp;and&nbsp;less&nbsp;saturated&nbsp;colors.&nbsp;Although&nbsp;I&nbsp;was&nbsp;not&nbsp;personally&nbsp;convinced&nbsp;by&nbsp;my&nbsp;design,&nbsp;the&nbsp;team&nbsp;decided&nbsp;to&nbsp;use&nbsp;it&nbsp;otherwise.</p>",
